{"id":"3615c7a093d0b56d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-bar-theorem.md","title":"Bar Theorem","display":"df-bar-theorem — Bar Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-bar-theorem","aliases":["72-df-bar-theorem"],"display":"df-bar-theorem — Bar Theorem","depends_on":["[[72-df-recursive-function]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Explicit local classical tree-bar variant; not attributed to a numbered book definition","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_kind":"local-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-bar-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-bar-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bar-theorem — Bar Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f38fcd2964b78d6c\" href=\"?note=f38fcd2964b78d6c\" title=\"72-df-recursive-function\">72-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Explicit local classical tree-bar variant; not attributed to a numbered book definition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>元理论ZFC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 非空且前缀封闭；根为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,P\\subseteq T\">\\(B,P\\subseteq T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]:=\\{f\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ f\\restriction n\\in T\\}\">\\([T]:=\\{f\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ f\\restriction n\\in T\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定有限列表的单射有效自然数编码c（例如递归素数列表编码）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dec}_T(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Dec}_T(B)\\)</span> 指存在总递归特征函数g，对s∈T有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(c(s))=1\\leftrightarrow s\\in B\">\\(g(c(s))=1\\leftrightarrow s\\in B\\)</span>，且g值域⊆{0,1}。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mon}_T(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mon}_T(B)\\)</span> 指B在T中对延长封闭。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(g,1)\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(g,1)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f38fcd2964b78d6c\" href=\"?note=f38fcd2964b78d6c\" title=\"72-df-recursive-function\">72-df-recursive-function</a> 中的一元总函数图谓词；输入为单项元组。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Bar}_T(B)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in[T]\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (f\\restriction n\\in B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_T(P)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in T[(\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ (s^\\frown\\langle k\\rangle\\in T\\to s^\\frown\\langle k\\rangle\\in P))\\to s\\in P],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Mon}_T(B)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s,t\\in T\\ (s\\in B\\land s\\preceq t\\to t\\in B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{BT}(T)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B,P\\subseteq T[(\\operatorname{Dec}_T(B)\\land\\operatorname{Mon}_T(B)\\land\\operatorname{Bar}_T(B)\\land B\\subseteq P\\land\\operatorname{Prog}_T(P))\\to()\\in P].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Bar}_T(B)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in[T]\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (f\\restriction n\\in B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_T(P)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in T[(\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ (s^\\frown\\langle k\\rangle\\in T\\to s^\\frown\\langle k\\rangle\\in P))\\to s\\in P],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Mon}_T(B)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s,t\\in T\\ (s\\in B\\land s\\preceq t\\to t\\in B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{BT}(T)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B,P\\subseteq T[(\\operatorname{Dec}_T(B)\\land\\operatorname{Mon}_T(B)\\land\\operatorname{Bar}_T(B)\\land B\\subseteq P\\land\\operatorname{Prog}_T(P))\\to()\\in P].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dec}_T(B):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\ [\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(g,1)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\ (g(\\langle c(s)\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow s\\in B)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dec}_T(B):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\ [\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(g,1)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\ (g(\\langle c(s)\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow s\\in B)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是树上的可判定单调bar归纳命题形式；本节点只定义它，没有声称在任意构造性基理论内已证。Bar只要求遇到每条无穷支，不能改成每个有限节点已延长B节点。Dec的计算模型由总递归函数定义给出，未要求T本身可判定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"f38fcd2964b78d6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"f38fcd2964b78d6c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(g,1)$ 是 [[72-df-recursive-function]] 中的一元总函数图谓词；输入为单项元组。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"()","display":false},{"tex":"B,P\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"[T]:=\\{f\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ f\\restriction n\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dec}_T(B)","display":false},{"tex":"g(c(s))=1\\leftrightarrow s\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mon}_T(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(g,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Bar}_T(B)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in[T]\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (f\\restriction n\\in B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_T(P)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in T[(\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ (s^\\frown\\langle k\\rangle\\in T\\to s^\\frown\\langle k\\rangle\\in P))\\to s\\in P],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Mon}_T(B)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s,t\\in T\\ (s\\in B\\land s\\preceq t\\to t\\in B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{BT}(T)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B,P\\subseteq T[(\\operatorname{Dec}_T(B)\\land\\operatorname{Mon}_T(B)\\land\\operatorname{Bar}_T(B)\\land B\\subseteq P\\land\\operatorname{Prog}_T(P))\\to()\\in P].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dec}_T(B):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\ [\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(g,1)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\ (g(\\langle c(s)\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow s\\in B)].","display":true}],"bytes":2335,"backlinks":[{"id":"18fee81c0ec38350","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"树 $T,B,P$、$\\operatorname{Bar}_T,\\operatorname{Prog}_T$ 如 [[72-df-bar-theorem]]。关系版本取 [[72-df-coded-well-order]] 的对象 $\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)$、$\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A)$；A遍历基本L2全部公式，D,R为不自由出现在A中的集变量。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-bar-theorem|df-bar-theorem — Bar Theorem]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-bar-theorem|df-bar-theorem — Bar Theorem]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-bar-theorem|72-df-bar-theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["f38fcd2964b78d6c"]}